(
  'Real Estate for Sale: How to Find Homes, Properties & Local Agents',
  'real-estate-for-sale',
  'Find real estate for sale across the U.S., from homes and condos to investment and commercial properties.',
  E'<h1>Real Estate for Sale: How to Find Homes, Properties &amp; Local Agents</h1>\n<p class="lead">Searching for <strong>real estate for sale</strong> is often the first step toward buying a home, finding an investment property, relocating, or exploring the local housing market.</p>\n<p>Whether you are searching for <strong>homes for sale</strong>, <strong>houses for sale near me</strong>, investment properties, commercial real estate, or a local real estate professional, Domestic Real Estate helps you explore property opportunities and connect with the resources you need.</p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties"><strong>Browse Real Estate for Sale</strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>What Does Real Estate for Sale Mean?</h2>\n<p>Real estate for sale includes properties currently offered to buyers - single-family homes, condos, townhouses, multi-family properties, land, commercial buildings, and investment properties.</p>\n<h2>How to Find Real Estate for Sale Near You</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose your preferred city or location.</li>\n<li>Set your price range.</li>\n<li>Select your property type.</li>\n<li>Choose the number of bedrooms and bathrooms.</li>\n<li>Compare available properties.</li>\n<li>Review details, photos, and disclosures.</li>\n<li>Contact a real estate professional when you are ready.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Start with <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">available properties on Domestic Real Estate</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Types of Real Estate You Can Search For</h2>\n<h3>Homes for Sale</h3>\n<p>Single-family homes are the most common choice for a primary residence. Compare location, price, condition, square footage, bedrooms, bathrooms, schools, transportation, and future resale value.</p>\n<h3>Condos and Townhomes</h3>\n<p>Condos and townhomes offer an alternative to single-family living. Review association fees, community rules, amenities, maintenance responsibilities, and overall community condition.</p>\n<h3>Investment Properties</h3>\n<p>Investors often look for properties that can produce rental income or appreciation. Base decisions on careful research and financial analysis.</p>\n<h3>Commercial Real Estate</h3>\n<p>Commercial property includes offices, retail, warehouses, industrial buildings, and multifamily assets.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>How to Choose the Right Real Estate Agent</h2>\n<p>A qualified <strong>real estate agent</strong> helps you understand local properties, arrange showings, evaluate offers, negotiate, and navigate the buying process.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Experience in your target market</li>\n<li>Knowledge of local neighborhoods</li>\n<li>Communication and availability</li>\n<li>Experience with your property type</li>\n<li>Understanding of current market conditions</li>\n<li>Professional credentials and licensing</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Looking for a professional in your area? <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin"><strong>Find a Realtor</strong></a> through Domestic Real Estate.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Understanding the Real Estate Market</h2>\n<p>The <strong>real estate market</strong> changes from one city and neighborhood to another. Research the specific market where you plan to buy.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Where can I find real estate for sale?</h3>\n<p>Search online marketplaces and local listing platforms. Visit <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Domestic Real Estate properties</a> to begin.</p>\n<h3>How do I find a real estate agent?</h3>\n<p>Look for an agent who understands your target market. Use the <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Domestic Real Estate Realtor directory</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Start Your Real Estate Search</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse Real Estate for Sale</a> | <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Find a Real Estate Agent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'market_trends',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Find real estate for sale across the U.S. from homes and condos to investment and commercial properties.',
  'Real Estate for Sale: Find Homes, Properties & Local Agents',
  array['real estate for sale','homes for sale','houses for sale near me','real estate agent']
),

-- 2
(
  'Homes for Sale Near Me: How to Find the Right Home in Your Area',
  'homes-for-sale-near-me',
  'Search homes for sale near you with Domestic Real Estate.',
  E'<h1>Homes for Sale Near Me: How to Find the Right Home in Your Area</h1>\n<p class="lead">"Homes for sale near me" is one of the highest-intent searches in real estate. When a buyer types it, they are usually past the dreaming stage and ready to see active inventory in their own area.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>How to Search for Homes for Sale Near You</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Start with your city, ZIP code, or neighborhood.</li>\n<li>Set a realistic price range.</li>\n<li>Choose your property type.</li>\n<li>Filter by bedrooms, bathrooms, and square footage.</li>\n<li>Save and compare your shortlist.</li>\n<li>Review photos, floor plans, and disclosures.</li>\n<li>Schedule showings for your top picks.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Begin with <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">homes for sale on Domestic Real Estate</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Filters That Actually Matter</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Price and monthly payment</li>\n<li>Location and commute time</li>\n<li>Bedrooms and bathrooms</li>\n<li>Square footage and lot size</li>\n<li>Property type</li>\n<li>Year built and condition</li>\n<li>HOA fees</li>\n<li>School district</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How do I find homes for sale near me?</h3>\n<p>Search a local marketplace with your city or ZIP code, then filter by price, type, and size. Start at <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Domestic Real Estate properties</a>.</p>\n<h3>What is a good first step for a first-time buyer?</h3>\n<p>Get pre-qualified, define your must-haves, and start touring homes in your price range with a <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">local real estate agent</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Find Your Next Home</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse Homes for Sale Near You</a> | <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Find a Local Agent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'buying_tips',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Search homes for sale near you with Domestic Real Estate. Learn how to find and compare local homes.',
  'Homes for Sale Near Me | Find Local Homes & Listings',
  array['homes for sale near me','home buying','local real estate','first-time buyer']
),

