(
  'Houses for Sale Near Me: How to Find the Right House in Your Area',
  'houses-for-sale-near-me',
  'Looking for houses for sale near me? Learn how to search local house listings.',
  E'<h1>Houses for Sale Near Me: How to Find the Right House in Your Area</h1>\n<p class="lead">Most buyers searching for houses for sale near me want one thing: single-family houses they can walk through, in neighborhoods they can picture themselves living in.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>How to Search for Houses Near You</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Pick your target neighborhoods or ZIP codes.</li>\n<li>Set your budget, including taxes and insurance.</li>\n<li>Choose minimum bedrooms, bathrooms, and lot size.</li>\n<li>Filter by property type and year built.</li>\n<li>Compare asking price against recent sales.</li>\n<li>Drive by the neighborhood before scheduling a tour.</li>\n<li>Book showings with a <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">local agent</a>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Start your search with <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">houses for sale on Domestic Real Estate</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>House vs. Condo vs. Townhome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>House:</strong> freestanding, more privacy, more maintenance.</li>\n<li><strong>Condo:</strong> shared building, lower maintenance, HOA fees.</li>\n<li><strong>Townhome:</strong> shared walls, own entrance, smaller yard.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How do I find houses for sale near me?</h3>\n<p>Search by city, ZIP code, or neighborhood on a local marketplace, then filter by price, size, and property type. See <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">available houses on Domestic Real Estate</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Browse Houses in Your Area</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">View Houses for Sale</a> | <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Find an Agent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'buying_tips',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Looking for houses for sale near me? Learn how to search local house listings and connect with a local agent.',
  'Houses for Sale Near Me | Find Houses in Your Area',
  array['houses for sale near me','single-family homes','home buying','neighborhood search']
),

