-- 5
(
  'Apartments for Rent: How to Find Your Next Rental Home',
  'apartments-for-rent',
  'Search apartments for rent with Domestic Real Estate.',
  E'<h1>Apartments for Rent: How to Find Your Next Rental Home</h1>\n<p class="lead">Millions of Americans search apartments for rent every month. A smart rental search is about more than the monthly rent.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Budget Before You Search</h2>\n<p>A common guideline is to keep housing costs at or below 30% of gross income.</p>\n<h2>How to Search Apartments for Rent</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Set your max monthly budget.</li>\n<li>Choose neighborhoods near work or transit.</li>\n<li>Filter by bedrooms, bathrooms, and amenities.</li>\n<li>Confirm what utilities are included.</li>\n<li>Tour in person before signing.</li>\n<li>Read the full lease and fee schedule.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Start with <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">rentals on Domestic Real Estate</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>How to Avoid Rental Scams</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Never wire money before seeing the unit.</li>\n<li>Verify the listing with the property manager.</li>\n<li>Be cautious of below-market pricing.</li>\n<li>Tour the actual apartment, not a model.</li>\n<li>Confirm who holds your deposit.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How much should I spend on rent?</h3>\n<p>A common target is 30% of gross income or less, including utilities.</p>\n<h3>How do I find apartments for rent near me?</h3>\n<p>Search a local rental marketplace by city or ZIP code - see <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">available rentals on Domestic Real Estate</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Find Your Next Apartment</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse Apartments for Rent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'buying_tips',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Search apartments for rent with Domestic Real Estate. Learn how to compare rent, budget, and avoid rental scams.',
  'Apartments for Rent | Find Your Next Rental Home',
  array['apartments for rent','renting','rental search','rental guide']
),

-- 6
(
  'First-Time Home Buyer Guide: Steps to Buy Your First Home',
  'first-time-home-buyer',
  'New to home buying? Learn the essential steps for first-time home buyers.',
  E'<h1>First-Time Home Buyer Guide: Steps to Buy Your First Home</h1>\n<p class="lead">Buying your first home is one of the biggest financial decisions you will ever make. With the right preparation, the process becomes clearer and less stressful.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Step 1: Check Your Finances</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Credit score - most lenders want 620+ for conventional loans</li>\n<li>Debt-to-income ratio - ideally under 43%</li>\n<li>Savings for down payment, closing costs, and emergency fund</li>\n<li>Stable employment history</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Step 2: Get Pre-Approved</h2>\n<p>A mortgage pre-approval tells you exactly how much you can borrow and shows sellers you are a serious buyer.</p>\n<h2>Step 3: Find a Real Estate Agent</h2>\n<p>A local agent who understands your target market can save you time and money. <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Connect with Veronica Medellin</a> to get started.</p>\n<h2>Step 4: Search for Homes</h2>\n<p>Use online marketplaces and your agent''s network to find homes that match your budget. <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse available properties</a>.</p>\n<h2>Step 5: Make an Offer</h2>\n<p>Your agent will help you craft a competitive offer based on comparable sales and market conditions.</p>\n<h2>Step 6: Home Inspection and Appraisal</h2>\n<p>A professional inspection reveals hidden issues. The appraisal confirms the home''s value for your lender.</p>\n<h2>Step 7: Close on Your New Home</h2>\n<p>Review all documents, sign your loan paperwork, and get your keys.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>First-Time Buyer Programs</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>FHA loans - 3.5% down payment</li>\n<li>VA loans - no down payment for eligible veterans</li>\n<li>USDA loans - zero down for rural areas</li>\n<li>State and local down payment assistance programs</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How much do I need for a down payment?</h3>\n<p>It depends on the loan type. Conventional loans typically require 3-20%, while FHA loans start at 3.5%.</p>\n<h3>Should I get pre-approved before house hunting?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Pre-approval tells you your budget and makes your offer stronger.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Ready to Buy Your First Home?</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse Homes for Sale</a> | <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Talk to an Agent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'buying_tips',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'New to home buying? Learn the essential steps for first-time home buyers including pre-approval and closing.',
  'First-Time Home Buyer Guide | Steps to Buy Your First Home',
  array['first-time home buyer','home buying tips','mortgage','down payment','pre-approval']
),

-- 7
(
  'How to Sell Your Home Fast: Tips for Home Sellers',
  'sell-your-home-fast',
  'Want to sell your home quickly? Learn proven strategies to list, price, and stage your home.',
  E'<h1>How to Sell Your Home Fast: Tips for Home Sellers</h1>\n<p class="lead">Selling a home does not have to take months. With the right pricing strategy, preparation, and marketing, you can attract serious buyers and close faster.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Price It Right from Day One</h2>\n<p>The biggest mistake sellers make is overpricing. Homes that sit on the market lose momentum.</p>\n<h2>Boost Your Curb Appeal</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fresh exterior paint or power wash</li>\n<li>Manicured lawn and landscaping</li>\n<li>New front door hardware and lighting</li>\n<li>Clean walkways and entry</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Stage Your Home to Sell</h2>\n<p>Staged homes sell faster and for more money. Declutter, depersonalize, deep clean, and arrange furniture to highlight space.</p>\n<h2>Professional Photography and Marketing</h2>\n<p>Most buyers start online. High-quality photos and compelling descriptions get more clicks. <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Work with an agent</a> who invests in marketing.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How long does it take to sell a home?</h3>\n<p>In most markets, 30-60 days from listing to closing.</p>\n<h3>Should I make repairs before selling?</h3>\n<p>Focus on high-ROI fixes: fresh paint, clean carpets, updated lighting, and minor cosmetic repairs.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Ready to Sell Your Home?</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Get a Free Home Valuation</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'selling_guide',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Want to sell your home quickly? Learn proven strategies to list, price, and stage your home for a fast sale.',
  'How to Sell Your Home Fast | Tips for Home Sellers',
  array['sell your home','home selling tips','staging','curb appeal','cash offer']
),

-- 8
(
  'Understanding Mortgage Rates: How to Get the Best Deal',
  'mortgage-rates-guide',
  'Learn how mortgage rates work and how to lock in the best rate for your home loan.',
  E'<h1>Understanding Mortgage Rates: How to Get the Best Deal</h1>\n<p class="lead">Mortgage rates directly affect how much house you can afford. Even a small difference in your rate can mean tens of thousands of dollars over the life of your loan.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Fixed vs. Adjustable Rates</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fixed-rate mortgage:</strong> Your rate stays the same for the entire loan term.</li>\n<li><strong>Adjustable-rate mortgage (ARM):</strong> Starts lower, then adjusts periodically.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What Determines Your Rate</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Credit score - higher scores get lower rates</li>\n<li>Down payment - more equity means less risk</li>\n<li>Loan type - FHA, VA, conventional, and jumbo</li>\n<li>Loan term - 15-year terms are cheaper than 30-year</li>\n<li>Market conditions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Get the Best Mortgage Rate</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Improve your credit score before applying</li>\n<li>Save for a larger down payment</li>\n<li>Compare offers from at least 3 lenders</li>\n<li>Consider buying discount points</li>\n<li>Lock your rate when you find a good one</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>What is a good mortgage rate?</h3>\n<p>Compare current averages for your loan type and credit score.</p>\n<h3>Should I pay for discount points?</h3>\n<p>If you plan to stay long enough to break even (usually 5-7 years), buying points upfront can lower your rate.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Explore Your Mortgage Options</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Talk to a Local Agent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse Homes for Sale</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'buying_tips',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Learn how mortgage rates work and how to lock in the best rate for your home loan.',
  'Understanding Mortgage Rates | How to Get the Best Deal',
  array['mortgage rates','home loan','refinance','credit score','down payment']
),

-- 9
(
  'Investment Properties: How to Start Building Wealth Through Real Estate',
  'investment-properties-guide',
  'Learn how to evaluate, finance, and manage investment properties for long-term wealth.',
  E'<h1>Investment Properties: How to Start Building Wealth Through Real Estate</h1>\n<p class="lead">Real estate has created more millionaires than any other asset class. Whether you are looking for rental income, long-term appreciation, or tax advantages, investment properties offer a path to financial growth.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Why Invest in Real Estate?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Monthly cash flow from rental income</li>\n<li>Long-term property appreciation</li>\n<li>Tax benefits - depreciation, deductions, and 1031 exchanges</li>\n<li>Inflation hedge</li>\n<li>Portfolio diversification</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Types of Investment Properties</h2>\n<h3>Single-Family Rentals</h3>\n<p>Steady demand, easier to manage, and accessible for new investors.</p>\n<h3>Multifamily Properties</h3>\n<p>Duplexes, triplexes, and apartment buildings generate more income per property.</p>\n<h3>Short-Term Rentals</h3>\n<p>Airbnb and vacation rentals can earn more per night but require active management.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>How to Evaluate an Investment Property</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cap rate - net operating income divided by purchase price</li>\n<li>Cash-on-cash return</li>\n<li>1% rule - monthly rent should be at least 1% of purchase price</li>\n<li>Local rental demand and vacancy rates</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How much money do I need to start?</h3>\n<p>Plan for 20-25% down plus closing costs, reserves, and initial repairs.</p>\n<h3>Is real estate investing risky?</h3>\n<p>All investments carry risk. Mitigate by researching markets and running conservative numbers.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Start Your Investment Journey</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse Investment Properties</a> | <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Talk to an Agent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'investment',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Learn how to evaluate, finance, and manage investment properties for long-term wealth through real estate.',
  'Investment Properties | Build Wealth Through Real Estate',
  array['investment properties','rental income','real estate investing','cap rate','cash flow']
),

-- 10
(
  'Clear Lake TX Neighborhood Guide: Living in Clear Lake',
  'clear-lake-neighborhood-guide',
  'Discover Clear Lake TX - schools, housing, things to do, and why buyers love this Houston-area neighborhood.',
  E'<h1>Clear Lake TX Neighborhood Guide: Living in Clear Lake</h1>\n<p class="lead">Clear Lake is one of the most sought-after neighborhoods in the Houston metropolitan area. Known for its strong community, excellent schools, and proximity to NASA Johnson Space Center.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Why Buyers Love Clear Lake</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong sense of community with active neighborhood associations</li>\n<li>Excellent Clear Creek ISD schools</li>\n<li>Proximity to NASA, the Texas Medical Center, and downtown Houston</li>\n<li>Access to Clear Lake, Galveston Bay, and coastal recreation</li>\n<li>Mature trees, established neighborhoods, and diverse housing options</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Housing in Clear Lake</h2>\n<p>Clear Lake features a mix of single-family homes, townhomes, and waterfront properties.</p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse homes for sale in Clear Lake</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Schools in Clear Lake</h2>\n<p>Clear Creek ISD serves the area and is consistently one of the top-rated districts in the Houston region.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Things to Do in Clear Lake</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>NASA Johnson Space Center and Space Center Houston</li>\n<li>Clear Lake and waterfront activities</li>\n<li>Ellington Airport and aviation history</li>\n<li>Local dining, shopping, and entertainment</li>\n<li>Parks and nature trails</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is Clear Lake a good place to live?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Clear Lake offers excellent schools, strong community, and easy access to Houston employment centers.</p>\n<h3>What is the average home price in Clear Lake?</h3>\n<p>Prices vary by section and condition. <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse current listings</a> for the latest market data.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class="cta">\n<p><strong>Explore Clear Lake</strong></p>\n<p><a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/properties">Browse Homes in Clear Lake</a> | <a href="https://www.domesticrealestate.us/agents/veronica-medellin">Talk to a Local Agent</a> | <a href="https://domesticrealestate.us/contact">Contact Domestic Real Estate</a></p>\n</div>',
  'community',
  'published',
  now(),
  'Veronica Medellin',
  'Discover Clear Lake TX - schools, housing, things to do, and why buyers love this Houston-area neighborhood.',
  'Clear Lake TX Neighborhood Guide | Living in Clear Lake',
  array['clear lake','houston neighborhoods','clear creek isd','nasa','community guide']
);

